# DEV ONLY ACL of the bundled Compose broker, applied to the authenticated listeners (1885 plain, 8883 TLS)
# in mosquitto.conf. The anonymous listeners (1883, 9001) have no ACL and keep full access.
#
# No rules before the first `user` line: anonymous clients have no access on these listeners
# (allow_anonymous is false there anyway).

# What a Pro-Act subscriber gets on the lab/plant broker (OT contract section 1): read-only on its topic filters.
user proact-test
topic read proact/#
topic read test/#

# The simulated gateway (scripts/mqtt/publish-sim.ts) and the persist-before-ack spike publish here.
user proact-sim
topic readwrite proact/#
topic readwrite test/#
topic readwrite spike/#
